# RIFTWORKS - generated files that must never be committed

# Unreal Engine generated folders
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/

# Visual Studio / IDE generated files
**/.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userprefs

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.temp

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# IMPORTANT: do not globally ignore .obj/.fbx/.glb/.gltf/.bin.
# Asset packs may legitimately contain those source formats.
# Keep source assets, Unreal Content, Config, Source and project files tracked.
